<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Monsanto cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Monsanto cut to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday it had cut its recommendation for Monsanto Co to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock was off 3/8 to 41-7/8 shortly after the market's opening.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
